<title>USA: Champaign, Ill., school bonds repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Champaign, Ill., school bonds repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said Wednesday it repriced Champaign Community School District No. 4, Ill.'s $23.7 million bond deal, lowering yields five basis points in several maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>CHAMPAIGN COMMUNITY SCHOOL DISTRICT 4</p>
<p>(CHAMPAIGN COUNTY, ILLINOIS)</p>
<p>RE: $23,685,000*</p>
<p>G.O. SCHOOL BONDS, SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT IS CLOSED.</p>
<p>REPRICING AS FOLLOWS:</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa3		 S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 06/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 07/01/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/01</p>
